    <property name="text">
     <string>A proper ground station does not simply display data. It transforms thousands of confusing numbers into slightly more organized confusion. Telemetry visualization systems allow operators to monitor mission health, track flight performance, and confidently announce problems they do not yet understand. Figure 8-1 shows the primary telemetry status display. These indicators help</string>
